        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Taylor Swift\n- Songs: Style, Blank Space, Out of the Woods\n- Albums: 1989, Now That's What I Call Music! 54\n- Companies: Republic Records, Big Machine Records\n- Charts: Billboard Hot 100\n\nFacts:\n- Taylor Swift released the song \"Blank Space\" on her 2014 fifth studio album \"1989\".\n- On the album \"1989\", the song \"Style\" comes before \"Out of the Woods\", which is the fourth track.\n- Republic Records, in partnership with Big Machine Records, released Taylor Swift's song \"Style\" to radio on February 9, 2015, as the third single from \"1989\", following \"Blank Space\".\n- The album \"Now That's What I Call Music! 54\" includes 21 tracks, including Taylor Swift's \"Billboard\" Hot 100 number-one hit \"Blank Space\".",
